    name: Gamble
    setences:
    - Looks like we survived that Round! But im sure theres more to come.
    - Go up to existing towers to see if you can upgrade.
    - Oh and one more thing, if you want me to run to a point faster, hold down [Left
      Shift]. I do get Tiered quick Though...
